<title>UK: AEA Technology H1 underlying profits rise.</title>
<headline>AEA Technology H1 underlying profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		0.9		    vs 6.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.75		   vs nil</p>
<p> Pretax		     1.1		    vs 5.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   111.8		  vs 108.3</p>
<p> Operating profit	 6.4		    vs 5.4</p>
<p> Exceptional charge     5.0		    vs nil</p>
<p> Interest payable	 0.1		    vs nil</p>
<p> Tax			  0.4		    vs nil</p>
<p> Net taxed		  0.7		    vs 5.3</p>
<p> Pay date		   Feb 3, 1997</p>
<p>Div registration date  Dec 10</p>
<p> Ex-div date		Dec 12</p>
<p>NOTE: Underlying earnings per share was 5.1p versus 4.5p.</p>
<p>AEA Technology Plc, a science and engineering firm, was floated in London in September.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
